Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That brings us to the\Nend of this masterclass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.53,0:00:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep three things in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,First, House Rent Allowance\Nfollows your place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of duty, not where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, the printed\Ntwenty four, sixteen and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,eight per cent is only\Nthe base rate; today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you draw thirty, twenty and ten per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And third, the Eighth\NPay Commission figures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you see online are demands, not law.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep revising, and see\Nyou in the next chapter.
